Package: PhyloConfigR
Title: Configure Inputs and Outputs for Phylogenetic Software
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Carl",
           family = "Hutter",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "carl.hutter@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6381-6339"))
Description: Provides functions to prepare alignments for phylogenomic analyses,
    summarize and filter alignment datasets, estimate and filter gene trees,
    run ASTRAL-III coalescent species tree analyses, compute and visualize
    IQ-TREE 2 concordance factors, detect anomaly zones, prepare input files
    for BPP and STRUCTURE, and run/parse HyPhy selection analyses (SLAC,
    BUSTED, aBSREL, FitMG94).
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
